<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37114" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξέλκ-ω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έλξω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					365
				</span></i>
			 (Pors.): aor. 1
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-είλκῠσα;</span>
			inf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ελκύσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pax</u>
					315
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				506
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ελκυσθῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.70
				</span></i>
			:— <i>draw, drag out,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.762
			</span></i>: c. gen. loci, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				5.432
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάσγανον . . ἐ. κολεοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					544
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑλλάδ᾽ ἐ. δουλίας</span>
			<i>rescue from</i> slavery, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				1.75
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύστηνον ἐ. πόδα,</span> of a
			lame man, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				291
			</span></i>: abs., without <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόδα,</span> of one
			wounded, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Andr.</u>
				1121
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξέλξω σε τῆς πυγῆς θύραζε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					365
				</span></i>
			 (Pors. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξελῶ</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">; ἐξελκύσαι τὴν πᾶσιν Εἰρήνην φίλην</span>
			<i>drag</i> her <i>out of the</i> cave, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pax</u>
				294
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				315
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				506
			</span></i>; rare in Prose, as <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				515e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξελκυσθείς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1311b30
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχναι τινὰ ἐ. τῆς πενίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Or.</u>
					39.14
				</span></i>
			.</div>
